@lrf=1|aud=GPT-5.6|scope=diary
R|file|*|MUST|LW_SCOPE|path=$env:USERPROFILE\.codex\diary.md; append=structured-entry; preserve-history=true; secrets/raw-credentials=omit
R|entry|*|MUST|LW_SCOPE|fields=timestamp,task,request-evidence,action,result,friction,attribution,impact,feedback,rewritten-request
R|prompt|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|critique human instruction only; categories=Underspecified⊕Contradiction⊕ImplicitContext⊕AmbiguousScope⊕MissingAcceptance⊕MissingEnvironment; cite exact/paraphrased evidence; separate valid ambiguity from mere preference
R|agent|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|classify own failures separately=Misreading⊕KnowledgeGap⊕Overthinking⊕ToolFailure⊕ScopeDrift; do not transfer agent fault to user
R|ratio|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|estimate PromptDefect% and AgentDefect%; explain causal basis and uncertainty; 0% only when evidence supports clarity
R|feedback|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|PromptDefect=>旦那様へ concise criticism+impact+minimal clarification+rewritten prompt; AgentDefect=>internal correction; both=>separate sections; tone=direct+constructive+no flattery
R|analyze|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|after task: llm-mem.exe analyze -file diary.md -suggest -json; output user feedback when PromptDefect>0 or ambiguity materially affected work; no rule patch from PromptDefect
R|no-defect|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|if no defensible defect, state evidence basis briefly; never invent ambiguity to satisfy quota
